WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.710
A dim study.

2
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:06.440
A thin young minister in black,
one hand pressed over his heart.

3
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:11.390
Beside him, a small, stooped old
man bends over jars of herbs.

4
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.780
He is the minister's doctor.

5
00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.400
The clock ticks.

6
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.840
The old man's shadow
grows larger and darker.

7
00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:21.080
The young man grows thinner.

8
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:26.450
"He now dug into the poor clergyman's
heart" One man hides a sin.

9
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.320
The other hunts for it.

10
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.040
Who does more harm?

11
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.730
In this mission, you'll see how
the two men come to share a house,

12
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.810
as patient and doctor.

13
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.520
You'll take apart the narrator's
images for the old man's search.

14
00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:44.110
And you'll watch what seven years of
searching does to the searcher himself.

15
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.410
Your mission: decide who does more harm.
